'SFT warm-up layer: data split + the generative validation metric.\n\n\nThe warm-up (``sft_warmup.py``) primes the model to emit the Qwen2.5\n``<tool_call>`` envelope before GRPO starts — the base model produces\nhigh-quality content but never emits a valid tool call (the cold-start probe:\n0/1488 valid calls at sampling), so the strict-harmonic reward has zero\nvariance and GRPO has no gradient to follow.'
